 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” roofer for every Dallas home, but **Arrington Roofing** looks like a strong first company to get a quote from: it has operated in the Dallas–Fort Worth area since 1983 and reports GAF Master Elite certification. **New View Roofing** is another option to compare; it also reports GAF Master Elite status. These credentials are useful signals, but they don’t guarantee the best price or experience for your particular project.\n\nBefore choosing, get **at least three written, itemized bids** and compare the exact materials, tear-off and disposal, ventilation and flashing work, cleanup, warranty terms, and payment schedule. Verify current insurance and certification directly, and check recent reviews from customers who had full replacements—not just repairs.",
